  intro x hx y hy
  exact box_nonneg_of_identity compact (1/4) (1/2) (1/2) 1 cert3 (by norm_num) (by norm_num)
    leaf3_coeff_nonneg (by simpa using leaf3_identity) (by simpa using hx) (by simpa using hy)
